ne.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1462325-what-kind-of-art-would-you-like-to-see-in-future-products?p=1462353#post1462353\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I want Rob Liefeld, with his usual eye for anatomical accuracy, to draw people and then have an editor label the subjects Tzimisce vampires.</div> </div> </div> </div>Please yes!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-03T12:10:01-07:00","id":1462575,"title":"","content":"Joking aside, I want less dull art.<br /> <br /> Most of the art in the books has been pretty good. But in the <i>Camarilla </i>book there were depictions of city skyline, a building side, and an unoccupied desk littered with stuff. None of this was very interesting. The building side got a full page spread and was so unremarkable felt like it was just there to take up space. Not every image needs to contain a person, but that is usually a way to keep an image from being so dull.<br /> <br /> I am fine with a mix of illustrations and photography.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_lin